<form autocomplete="off">
    {{#if hasShipProfiles}}
    <div class="form-group fsa-profile-selector">
        <label>Ship Profile</label>
        <div class="form-fields">
            <select name="shipProfileName">
                {{#each shipOptions}}
                <option value="{{name}}" {{#if selected}}selected{{/if}}>{{name}}</option>
                {{/each}}
            </select>
        </div>
        <p class="notes">Profiles are matched by ship name. Every vehicle with the same name uses the same profile.</p>
        {{#if isTokenConfig}}
        <p class="notes">This token is named {{tokenName}}. Saving a different profile makes this token use that profile.</p>
        {{/if}}
        <p class="notes">Sound, thrust, rotation, hover, and shield visuals are saved to the selected profile.</p>
    </div>
    {{/if}}

    <nav class="tabs" data-group="primary">
        <a class="item active" data-tab="general"><i class="fas fa-sliders-h"></i> General</a>
        <a class="item" data-tab="thrusters"><i class="fas fa-fire"></i> Thrusters</a>
        <a class="item" data-tab="rotation"><i class="fas fa-sync-alt"></i> Rotation</a>
        <a class="item" data-tab="hover"><i class="fas fa-arrows-alt"></i> Hover</a>
        <a class="item" data-tab="shields"><i class="fas fa-shield-alt"></i> Shields</a>
    </nav>

    <div class="fsa-effects-body">
    <section class="tab active" data-tab="general" data-group="primary">
        <div class="form-group">
            <label>Orientation</label>
            <div class="form-fields">
                <select name="vehicleBowFacing">
                    {{#each bowOptions}}
                    <option value="{{value}}" {{#if selected}}selected{{/if}}>{{label}}</option>
                    {{/each}}
                </select>
            </div>
            <p class="notes">Vehicle/Craft bow faces this direction before Foundry applies token rotation.</p>
        </div>

        <hr>

        <div class="form-group">
            <label>Movement Sound</label>
            <input type="checkbox" name="enableMovementSound" {{checked enableMovementSound}}>
            <p class="notes">Play a sound when a vehicle token starts moving.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="form-group">
            <label>Ship Sound File</label>
            <div class="form-fields">
                <input type="text" name="movementSoundPath" value="{{movementSoundPath}}">
                <button type="button" data-action="browse-sound" title="Browse audio files">
                    <i class="fas fa-folder-open"></i>
                </button>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="form-group">
            <label>Sound Volume</label>
            <div class="form-fields">
                <input type="range" name="movementSoundVolume" value="{{movementSoundVolume}}" min="0" max="1" step="0.05" data-sync-range="movementSoundVolume">
                <input type="number" value="{{movementSoundVolume}}" min="0" max="1" step="0.05" data-sync-number="movementSoundVolume">
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <section class="tab" data-tab="thrusters" data-group="primary">
        <div class="form-group">
            <label>Thruster Effect</label>
            <input type="checkbox" name="enableThrusterEffect" {{checked enableThrusterEffect}}>
            <p class="notes">Show a faded thrust cone underneath moving vehicle tokens. Preview is always shown while tuning.</p>
        </div>

        <div data-thruster-controls {{#unless enableThrusterEffect}}style="display: none;"{{/unless}}>
            <div class="form-group">
                <label>Scale</label>
                <div class="form-fields">
                    <input type="range" name="thrusterScale" value="{{thrusterScale}}" min="-10" max="10" step="0.5" data-sync-range="thrusterScale">
                    <input type="number" value="{{thrusterScale}}" min="-10" max="10" step="0.5" data-sync-number="thrusterScale">
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="form-group">
                <label>Position</label>
                <div class="form-fields">
                    <input type="range" name="thrusterPosition" value="{{thrusterPosition}}" min="-6" max="6" step="0.25" data-sync-range="thrusterPosition">
                    <input type="number" value="{{thrusterPosition}}" min="-6" max="6" step="0.25" data-sync-number="thrusterPosition">
                </div>
            </div>

            <fieldset>
                <legend>Primary Thrust</legend>

                {{#if hasShipProfiles}}
                <div class="form-group">
                    <label>Color</label>
                    <div class="form-fields">
                        <input type="color" name="shipThrusterColor" value="{{shipThrusterColor}}" data-color-picker="shipThrusterColor">
                        <input type="text" data-color-text="shipThrusterColor" value="{{shipThrusterColor}}">
                    </div>
                </div>
                {{/if}}

                <div class="form-group">
                    <label>Length</label>
                    <div class="form-fields">
                        <input type="range" name="thrusterLength" value="{{thrusterLength}}" min="0.25" max="12" step="0.25" data-sync-range="thrusterLength">
                        <input type="number" value="{{thrusterLength}}" min="0.25" max="12" step="0.25" data-sync-number="thrusterLength">
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div class="form-group">
                    <label>Width</label>
                    <div class="form-fields">
                        <input type="range" name="thrusterWidth" value="{{thrusterWidth}}" min="0.1" max="6" step="0.05" data-sync-range="thrusterWidth">
                        <input type="number" value="{{thrusterWidth}}" min="0.1" max="6" step="0.05" data-sync-number="thrusterWidth">
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div class="form-group">
                    <label>Invert</label>
                    <input type="checkbox" name="thrusterInverted" {{checked thrusterInverted}}>
                </div>
            </fieldset>

            <details>
                <summary><i class="fas fa-cog"></i> Advanced Thrust</summary>

                <div class="form-group">
                    <label>Thrust Count</label>
                    <div class="form-fields">
                        <input type="range" name="coneCount" value="{{coneCount}}" min="1" max="3" step="1" data-sync-range="coneCount">
                        <input type="number" value="{{coneCount}}" min="1" max="3" step="1" data-sync-number="coneCount">
                    </div>
                    <p class="notes">Thrust count includes Primary Thrust. Additional thrust controls appear as needed.</p>
                </div>

                <div class="form-group">
                    <label>Thrust Spacing</label>
                    <div class="form-fields">
                        <input type="range" name="coneSpacing" value="{{coneSpacing}}" min="0" max="6" step="0.05" data-sync-range="coneSpacing">
                        <input type="number" value="{{coneSpacing}}" min="0" max="6" step="0.05" data-sync-number="coneSpacing">
                    </div>
                </div>

                {{#each extraCones}}
                <fieldset data-extra-thrust-index="{{index}}">
                    <legend>Additional Thrust {{letter}}</legend>

                    <div class="form-group">
                        <label>Color</label>
                        <div class="form-fields">
                            <input type="color" name="extraCone{{index}}Color" value="{{color}}" data-color-picker="extraCone{{index}}Color">
                            <input type="text" data-color-text="extraCone{{index}}Color" value="{{color}}">
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <div class="form-group">
                        <label>Length</label>
                        <div class="form-fields">
                            <input type="range" name="extraCone{{index}}Length" value="{{length}}" min="0.25" max="12" step="0.25" data-sync-range="extraCone{{index}}Length">
                            <input type="number" value="{{length}}" min="0.25" max="12" step="0.25" data-sync-number="extraCone{{index}}Length">
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <div class="form-group">
                        <label>Width</label>
                        <div class="form-fields">
                            <input type="range" name="extraCone{{index}}Width" value="{{width}}" min="0.1" max="6" step="0.05" data-sync-range="extraCone{{index}}Width">
                            <input type="number" value="{{width}}" min="0.1" max="6" step="0.05" data-sync-number="extraCone{{index}}Width">
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <div class="form-group">
                        <label>Invert</label>
                        <input type="checkbox" name="extraCone{{index}}Inverted" {{checked inverted}}>
                    </div>
                </fieldset>
                {{/each}}
            </details>
        </div>
    </section>

    <section class="tab" data-tab="rotation" data-group="primary">
        <div class="form-group">
            <label>Enable Vehicle Rotation When Moved</label>
            <input type="checkbox" name="enableShipRotation" {{checked enableShipRotation}}>
            <p class="notes">Automatically face vehicle tokens toward their movement destination.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="form-group">
            <label>Smooth Rotation During Movement</label>
            <input type="checkbox" name="rotateBeforeMove" {{checked rotateBeforeMove}}>
            <p class="notes">Rotate vehicles by the shortest path while they start moving instead of instantly snapping to the destination heading.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="form-group">
            <label>Rotation Update Interval</label>
            <div class="form-fields">
                <input type="range" name="rotationDelayMs" value="{{rotationDelayMs}}" min="25" max="500" step="25" data-sync-range="rotationDelayMs">
                <input type="number" value="{{rotationDelayMs}}" min="25" max="500" step="25" data-sync-number="rotationDelayMs">
            </div>
            <p class="notes">How often, in milliseconds, to publish smooth rotation updates while a vehicle starts moving.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="form-group">
            <label>Rotation Finish Distance</label>
            <div class="form-fields">
                <input type="range" name="rotationFinishSquares" value="{{rotationFinishSquares}}" min="0.25" max="10" step="0.25" data-sync-range="rotationFinishSquares">
                <input type="number" value="{{rotationFinishSquares}}" min="0.25" max="10" step="0.25" data-sync-number="rotationFinishSquares">
            </div>
            <p class="notes">How many grid spaces the vehicle may travel before it has finished rotating to its new heading.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="form-group">
            <label>Rotation Offset</label>
            <div class="form-fields">
                <input type="range" name="rotationOffset" value="{{rotationOffset}}" min="-180" max="180" step="15" data-sync-range="rotationOffset">
                <input type="number" value="{{rotationOffset}}" min="-180" max="180" step="15" data-sync-number="rotationOffset">
            </div>
            <p class="notes">Advanced degrees added to the calculated heading after Orientation is applied.</p>
        </div>
    </section>

    <section class="tab" data-tab="hover" data-group="primary">
        <div class="form-group">
            <label>Vehicles have a hover effect</label>
            <input type="checkbox" name="enableVehicleHoverEffect" {{checked enableVehicleHoverEffect}}>
            <p class="notes">Gently move vehicle token art in place using this ship profile's built-in hover motion.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="form-group">
            <label>X Offset</label>
            <div class="form-fields">
                <input type="range" name="hoverOffsetX" value="{{hoverOffsetX}}" min="0" max="50" step="0.5" data-sync-range="hoverOffsetX">
                <input type="number" value="{{hoverOffsetX}}" min="0" max="50" step="0.5" data-sync-number="hoverOffsetX">
            </div>
            <p class="notes">Horizontal drift in pixels for this ship profile. The hover path uses a soft irregular pattern.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="form-group">
            <label>Y Offset</label>
            <div class="form-fields">
                <input type="range" name="hoverOffsetY" value="{{hoverOffsetY}}" min="0" max="50" step="0.5" data-sync-range="hoverOffsetY">
                <input type="number" value="{{hoverOffsetY}}" min="0" max="50" step="0.5" data-sync-number="hoverOffsetY">
            </div>
            <p class="notes">Vertical drift in pixels for this ship profile. The hover path uses a soft irregular pattern.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="form-group">
            <label>Speed</label>
            <div class="form-fields">
                <input type="range" name="hoverSpeed" value="{{hoverSpeed}}" min="0.1" max="5" step="0.1" data-sync-range="hoverSpeed">
                <input type="number" value="{{hoverSpeed}}" min="0.1" max="5" step="0.1" data-sync-number="hoverSpeed">
            </div>
            <p class="notes">Speed multiplier for this ship profile's hover cycle.</p>
        </div>
    </section>

    <section class="tab" data-tab="shields" data-group="primary">
        <div class="form-group">
            <label>Automatically Manage Vehicle Shields</label>
            <input type="checkbox" name="vehicleShieldAutomation" {{checked vehicleShieldAutomation}}>
            <p class="notes">Ships that have Shield Generators, or Morphogenetic Fields, will automatically have shields drawn so long as they are equipped and contain HP, once the HP runs to 0, the shield will be removed. Shields will also be restored upon healing and repair.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="form-group">
            <label>Vehicle Protection Visual Mode</label>
            <div class="form-fields">
                <select name="vehicleProtectionVisualMode">
                    {{#each protectionVisualModes}}
                    <option value="{{value}}" {{#if selected}}selected{{/if}}>{{label}}</option>
                    {{/each}}
                </select>
            </div>
            <p class="notes">Built-In FSA Glow draws a soft pulsating outline from the token silhouette without TokenMagic. TokenMagic FX uses compatible TokenMagic glow filters when that module is installed.</p>
        </div>
    </section>
    </div>

    <footer class="sheet-footer flexrow">
        <button type="submit">
            <i class="fas fa-save"></i> Save
        </button>
    </footer>
</form>
